{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ScramBrawl\u00a0is a party game where you fight as clumsy, half boiled beings. Blast your buddies with yolk missiles, slap them with fish and much more. Scramble your way to victory in hilarious, chaotic brawls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOLK AROUND WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with upto 4 players in local multiplayer or Steam Remote Play Together. Or practise solo against AI eggs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAUNCH YOUR YOLK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your yolk and send eggs flying with a satisfying yolky blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/4038668baf957b9e1997f3f2d043b744.poster.avif?t=1758920808\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/4038668baf957b9e1997f3f2d043b744.webm?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/4038668baf957b9e1997f3f2d043b744.mp4?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO YOLK? NO PROBLEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything as a weapon, especially fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/19ec4d0169c45f5e44ce414cef069884.poster.avif?t=1758920808\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/19ec4d0169c45f5e44ce414cef069884.webm?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/19ec4d0169c45f5e44ce414cef069884.mp4?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM UP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your eggy allies and pick a side for a Red Vs. Blue battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGGSQUISITE PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's fun to throw a sleepy egg.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/b4137072107f276e13ac193fae84c815.poster.avif?t=1758920808\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/b4137072107f276e13ac193fae84c815.webm?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/b4137072107f276e13ac193fae84c815.mp4?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGGSPRESS YOURSELF WITH CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in style with a lovely hat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/ab41bf27508933feb742147608e6304f.poster.avif?t=1758920808\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/ab41bf27508933feb742147608e6304f.webm?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884440/extras/ab41bf27508933feb742147608e6304f.mp4?t=1758920808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamst